:"\u003chttps://twitter.com/yopparai_chmist/status/1454594408800669697\u003e","ts":"1635644837.060300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/yopparai_chmist|@yopparai_chmist\u003e: おーこれ凄い。植物等が行うCO2をデンプンに変換する反応を、無細胞系で達成したという報告。11のコア反応からなる人工デンプン同化経路は、遺伝子編集した酵素で設計される。水素があれば総触媒1mgあたり毎分22nmolのCO2をデンプンに変換し、これはトウモロコシのデンプン合成の約8.5倍の速度とのこと \u003chttps://twitter.com/sciencemagazine/status/1454478251724783619\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"酔っ払い科学者","author_subname":"@yopparai_chmist","author_link":"https://twitter.com/yopparai_chmist/status/1454594408800669697","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1183711928553635842/vmJF0BDE_normal.jpg","text":"おーこれ凄い。植物等が行うCO2をデンプンに変換する反応を、無細胞系で達成したという報告。11のコア反応からなる人工デンプン同化経路は、遺伝子編集した酵素で設計される。水素があれば総触媒1mgあたり毎分22nmolのCO2をデンプンに変換し、これはトウモロコシのデンプン合成の約8.5倍の速度とのこと \u003chttps://twitter.com/sciencemagazine/status/1454478251724783619\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1635637306,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/yopparai_chmist/status/1454594408800669697","original_url":"https://twitter.com/yopparai_chmist/status/1454594408800669697"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ScienceMagazine|@ScienceMagazine\u003e: From carbon dioxide to starch—no plants required: Researchers have developed a novel, cell-free method of synthesizing starch from CO2 and hydrogen using a combination of chemical catalysts and a carefully selected set of enzymes in a cell-free approach. \u003chttps://fcld.ly/tdz3er4\u003e \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FC9YQrDWQAU7ymA.jpg\u003e","id":2,"author_name":"Science Magazine","author_subname":"@ScienceMagazine","author_link":"https://twitter.com/ScienceMagazine/status/1454478251724783619","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1001918231752429568/wUNPvDdW_normal.jpg","text":"From carbon dioxide to starch—no plants required: Researchers have developed a